      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_40",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maudie",
            text: _("Tut-tut, the mermaid followed me all this way? Show some deference, fish. Soon you’ll be calling me your lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("It’s not just merfolk who followed you here. I’m here to avenge my brother, you soulless murderer!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maudie",
            text: _("My, such language. Who in the world are you talking about?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("My brother! The mustached javelineer you drowned not two days ago?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maudie",
            text: _("I’m sorry, sweetie, you smallfolk all look the same to me. But if you’re so beaten up about his death, I’d be happy to help you join him. Shipmaster, is my fleet ready?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "leader3",
            text: _("Not yet, milady. As we’ve discussed, repairing derelicts takes quite some time. It might still be weeks—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maudie",
            text: _("Yes, yes, I remember now. Just... deal with these peasants, will you? That business with the freed prisoners has given me a terrible headache. I’m really not in the mood to entertain riff-raff."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_41",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "turn_number",
                greater_than_or_equal_to: 14,
              },
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%221%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2222%22%2C%22radius%22%3A%2212%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maudie",
            text: _("Fine! Since these ships cannot serve me in any useful capacity, set them ablaze and send them to run down anything in the water!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_object",
            object_id: "immobile_derelict",
            type: "Derelict",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
